### 1. Login first to get token
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

### 2. Create Workspace
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Board Test Workspace"
}

### 3. Create Project
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Board Test Project"
}

### 4. Create Board
# @name createBoard
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Sprint Board"
}

### 5. Get All Boards
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 6. Get Board by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 7. Update Board
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Updated Sprint Board"
}

### 8. Delete Board (Archive)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN









